---
import { SHOWCASE_LINK_TOKEN } from 'astro:env/server';
import './hireme.scss';

const showcaseHref = SHOWCASE_LINK_TOKEN
  ? `/showcase?t=${encodeURIComponent(SHOWCASE_LINK_TOKEN)}`
  : '/showcase';
---

<main class='main-page-content hireme-page'>
  <h1 class='hireme-title'>Howdy! 🤠</h1>
  <section class='hireme-section'>
    <p>
      Welcome to my "Hire Me" page. If you've landed on this page, you've likely
      been linked to it by me, or you've delved into some serious detective
      work.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class='hireme-section'>
    <h2 class='hireme-section-title'>Current Role</h2>
    <p>
      I am currently employed as a Staff Software Engineer at <a
        class='marker marker-purple'
        href='https://www.varomoney.com/'
        rel='noopener noreferrer'>Varo Bank</a
      >. During my tenure there, I've bounced around different projects and
      teams but lately have been focusing on building out our suite of Lending
      products.
    </p>
    <p>Some things I've worked on include:</p>
    <ul class='hireme-list'>
      <li>
        Lead frontend engineer on new Lending products, taking them from 0 to 1
        and working across the stack (React, React Native, GraphQL/Node.js,
        Kotlin/Postgres).
      </li>
      <li>
        Led our Design System v2 and v3 efforts: Figma to design tokens, 40+
        accessible components across iOS, Android and web, documented in
        Storybook, and now used across all of our products.
      </li>
      <li>
        Maintain our UX standards and act as the go-to engineer for Design
        System changes and reviews.
      </li>
      <li>
        Helped rewrite our apps from native Swift/Android to React Native
        (Expo), and led a team of 3-4 engineers on the Settings experience.
      </li>
      <li>
        Established AI tooling standards (AGENTS.md templates, skills,
        prompt/eval practices, agentic workflows) and drove adoption across
        teams.
      </li>
      <li>
        Integrated <a
          class='marker marker-orange marker-tilt-3'
          href='https://statsig.com/'
          rel='noopener noreferrer'>Statsig</a
        > for feature flags and experiments, and Column Tax for <a
          class='marker marker-white'
          href='https://finance.yahoo.com/news/varo-rolls-free-tax-prep-120838379.html?guccounter=1&guce_referrer=aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuZ29vZ2xlLmNvbS8&guce_referrer_sig=AQAAANmSeTGnVURdC1SN5lnuRdpNQYL6XnENjL2fV6YFW7w8L0QOeLm1oNhffFzEn42tuRL1C-5fvuDsDXHVlxux2bsAhYCs212Si9AQaWam0qxfhPCRLtItbVwesotZI2lYY5F3_H-M_Wr6YKQSd-JU6JuGuuuKRJnsHMY9xUAfk4Rh'
          rel='noopener noreferrer'>in-app tax prep</a
        >.
      </li>
      <li>
        Led web adoption of the <a
          class='marker marker-yellow marker-tilt-down-1'
          href='https://www.apollographql.com/docs/technotes/TN0032-sdui-basics/'
          rel='noopener noreferrer'>server-driven UI</a
        > architectural pattern and helped launch the new bank.varomoney.com.
      </li>
      <li>
        Mentor and onboard engineers; hosted React workshops to help our iOS and
        Android engineers ramp up.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      My code typically gets shipped to production once a week. I primarily work
      with technologies such as: TypeScript, React, React Native (Expo), GraphQL
      with Apollo and React Testing Library with Jest on the frontend and
      Kotlin, PostgreSQL, GraphQL, Node.js and gRPC on the backend. For a closer
      look at my work, check out my <a
        class='marker marker-purple marker-tilt-down-2'
        href={showcaseHref}>🪩 Showcase</a
      > page.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class='hireme-section'>
    <h2 class='hireme-section-title'>Previously</h2>
    <p>
      Before my tenure at Varo, I held positions as a Senior Full-stack/Frontend
      Developer at <a
        class='marker marker-amber marker-tilt-3'
        href='https://www.tzero.com/'
        rel='noopener noreferrer'>tZERO</a
      > and <a
        class='marker marker-purple marker-tilt-down-1'
        href='https://www.overstock.com/'
        rel='noopener noreferrer'>Overstock.com</a
      >. In those roles, I spearheaded projects using technologies such as
      React, Redux, NodeJS, Express, and PostgreSQL on the backend.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class='hireme-section'>
    <h2 class='hireme-section-title'>Working Style</h2>
    <p>
      Although I primarily focus on the frontend and client-side code, I
      consider myself a well-rounded Engineer with the ability to work across
      the entire tech stack and do so independently. My staff engineering
      archetype is "the fixer," which means I usually get thrown on projects to
      help get them across the finish line or to solve ambiguous problems and
      unblock teams. I spent most of my career working with web technologies but
      recently found out I really enjoy React Native and the mobile space. I
      have a strong love for the UI aspects of client-side Engineering, real
      design taste, and keen attention to detail, whether it pertains to pixels
      or code. This attention to detail is what I consider my "superpower." Give
      me a Figma file or a rough sketch and I'll turn it into a polished,
      shipped product quickly.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class='hireme-section'>
    <h2 class='hireme-section-title'>Education</h2>
    <p>
      My academic background includes a Bachelor of Science degree in Strategic
      Communication from the University of Utah, as well as an Associate of
      Science degree from Salt Lake Community College.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class='hireme-section'>
    <h2 class='hireme-section-title'>Interested In</h2>
    <p>
      I gravitate toward teams that genuinely care about UX and product quality,
      ship often, and have a strong engineering culture where code review is
      taken seriously. I'm especially drawn to 0-to-1 opportunities where I can
      have real impact on product direction. Company values and outlook matter
      to me just as much as the technical stack.
    </p>
    <p>
      Some current technologies that interest me: TypeScript, React, React
      Native, Expo, Astro, NextJS, RemixJS, NestJS, Fastify, Bun, Tailwind CSS,
      shadcn/ui and Radix UI. Would love to work or continue to work with these
      in my next role.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class='hireme-section'>
    <h2 class='hireme-section-title'>Outside of Work</h2>
    <p>
      Outside of work, I take pleasure in spending time outdoors with my dog,
      Arto, and my girlfriend, Jordan. I also have a passion for cycling and
      running. For more on that, check out my <a
        class='marker marker-orange'
        href='https://www.strava.com/athletes/256235'
        rel='noopener noreferrer'>Strava</a
      >.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class='hireme-section'>
    <p>
      Thank you for your consideration, and I look forward to further
      discussion. Cheers 🤙
    </p>
  </section>
  <div class='hireme-actions'>
    <a class='back-link' href='/'>Home</a>
    <a class='back-link' href='/resume'>Resume</a>
    <a class='back-link' href={showcaseHref}>🪩 Showcase</a>
  </div>
</main>
